  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c052724c165f89a43a01ab84f981b02c, type: 2}
    portraitExpression: 16
    localizedTexts:
    - languageCode: en
      text: I tried to organize my thoughts yesterday.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c052724c165f89a43a01ab84f981b02c, type: 2}
    portraitExpression: 20
    localizedTexts:
    - languageCode: en
      text: They formed a queue, then immediately started arguing about hats.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c052724c165f89a43a01ab84f981b02c, type: 2}
    portraitExpression: 21
    localizedTexts:
    - languageCode: en
      text: I left them there and had some soup instead.
